@id: a2f7
the instruction sheet turns claude into the compiler.

human code arrives in prose.
the compiler emits the sentences, the code, the map, and the registry.
the map connects every sentence to the characters it caused.

note: the direction is map-over-existing-text. build/CLAUDE.md is the spec itself, byte for byte, LF-normalized. nothing was regenerated or reworded. the spec that makes claude the compiler is here a compiled artifact of the language.
